<title>CHINA: TENNIS-SHANGHAI OPEN FINALS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SHANGHAI OPEN FINALS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of finals in the Shanghai Open tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Singles</p>
<p>7-Jan Kroslak (Slovakia) beat 8-Alexander Volkov (Russia) 6-2 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>Doubles</p>
<p>Max Myrnyi (Belarus)/Kevin Ullyett (South Africa) beat Tomas Nydahl (Sweden)/Stefano Pescosolido (Italy) 7-6 (7-5) 6-7 (4-7) 7-5</p>
</text>
